 "remarks": "4-bedroom, 2.5-bathroom home on a private, large lot in West Norwalk, with a private entrance in-law potential on the lower level. Solar panels and central air conditioning provide year-round comfort and help manage energy costs. A picture window brings natural light into the living area, and wood flooring and carpeting run through the interior. The lower level which suits extended-stay guests, a home office, or a separate living area. Four bedrooms upstairs offer flexibility for guest rooms, a hobby space, or a work-from-home setup. Two full baths and a half bath serve the home. Outside, a spacious deck overlooks the large backyard, which includes a dedicated garden area, a good fit for outdoor dining, entertaining, or growing vegetables and flowers. The private setting gives the property a secluded feel in West Norwalk. A move-in-ready option for buyers seeking space, privacy, and flexible living in West Norwalk.",
